  "description": "Van Dessel™ Linefinder Frame – Precision. Control. Versatility.\n\nThe Van Dessel Linefinder is built for riders who demand efficiency on the climbs and confidence on the descents. With modern geometry, a responsive suspension platform, and a premium Fox Float X Factory rear shock, it’s ready for whatever the trail throws your way.\n120mm Rear Travel with Fox Float X Factory (185x50)Balanced, efficient travel with adjustable damping for aggressive trail riding and plush performance.\nHorst Link 4-Bar Suspension + Fox Float XFully active under all conditions — including braking — for maximum traction, control, and smooth rebound.\n130mm Front Travel (compatible up to 140mm)Versatile setup for tackling everything from technical singletrack to all-day epics.\n29x2.4\" Tire ClearanceConfident grip and smooth rollover for modern trail tires.\nIntegrated Cable RoutingClean, quiet cockpit with easy maintenance access.\nAdjustable ReachCustom-fit geometry to match your style and terrain.\nIncluded: Frame, Fox Float X Factory rear shock, rear thru axle, headset, seat clampNot Included: Bottom bracket or other parts required to complete build\nNOTE: Requires T47 bottom bracket\nReady to build your dream trail bike? The Linefinder frameset is the perfect foundation.",
